# Project: Decisions

Purpose:
  Define how project-level decisions are stored, indexed, and traced.
  This file defines the SHAPE only — concrete decisions belong to the
  instantiated project.

Storage:
  project/<domain>/decisions/<state>/*.sdd

  Where <state> is one of: pending / approved / rejected / superseded

  Example:
    project/<domain>/decisions/pending/DEC-<ID>.sdd
    project/<domain>/decisions/approved/DEC-<ID>.sdd

DecisionIndex:
  Each domain MAY maintain an INDEX.sdd for fast lookup:

    Domain: @<domain>
    Active: DEC-<ID>, DEC-<ID>
    Review: DEC-<ID>
    Superseded: DEC-<ID>, DEC-<ID>

  AI MUST load INDEX first, then only the relevant decisions.

DecisionRetrieval:
  Task -> Domain -> Decision INDEX -> affected decisions -> only relevant DEC files

DecisionImpactWorkflow:
  NEW DECISION
    -> COMPARE
    -> CONFLICT CHECK
    -> IMPACT ANALYSIS
      -> SKILL IMPACT
      -> GRAPH IMPACT
      -> TASK IMPACT
      -> DOC IMPACT
    -> HUMAN GATE
    -> APPROVE
    -> CREATE / UPDATE TASKS

RelationModel:
  DependsOn:     decision depends on another decision
  Supersedes:    decision replaces an older decision
  Conflicts:     decision contradicts another decision
  Affects:       decision affects a project element
  DerivedFrom:   decision derived from another decision
  Requires:      decision requires a skill
  ReviewedBy:    decision reviewed by
  ImplementedBy: decision implemented by a task
  VerifiedBy:    decision verified by a QA task

TokenEconomy:
  ->  affects
  =>  produces
  <-  depends
  ~   pending
  +   accepted
  !   conflict/fail
  x   superseded
  @   review

DecisionStates:
  ~ proposed
  @ review
  + accepted
  ! rejected
  x superseded
  ? deprecated

Navigation:
  Schema: @../../schemas/decision.sdd
  Workflow: @../../decisions/workflow.sdd
  Rules: @../../decisions/rules.sdd
  Template: @../../../templates/_sdd/decisions/DEC-000.template.sdd

State: +
